# Migration image (Flyway) — Netty CVEs shaded into Flyway's own core-io
# module (io.netty:netty-handler / netty-codec-http2, bundled inside
# core-io-3.12.0.jar), not a vendor JDBC driver we ship or control.
# Not yet patched upstream by Flyway as of 13.5.0 (latest available).
#
# Accepted risk: this image only ever runs `flyway migrate` against our
# own private RDS instance from inside a locked-down VPC (no inbound
# traffic, no HTTP/2 or SPDY server exposed) — these are server-side DoS /
# codec vulnerabilities with no real attack surface in how we use this
# image. Revisit and remove these lines once Flyway ships a patched
# core-io release.
CVE-2026-44249
CVE-2026-45416
CVE-2026-50010
CVE-2026-56745
CVE-2026-56819
